sequenceDiagram
 participant M as Mobile
 participant A as API
 participant P as PostgreSQL
 participant R as Redis
 participant W as Worker
 M->>A: create plan generation (idempotency key)
 A->>P: persist job/outbox
 A->>R: enqueue committed job id
 A-->>M: 202 job id
 W->>P: lease + heartbeat
 W->>W: providers outside transaction
 W->>P: publish or retry/dead-letter
